      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "common_0100_rival_09",
      "hash64": "528ED23E05FEBEB1",
      "text": "那麼就一邊和野生寶可夢對戰，\\n捕捉牠們……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
